106	/**
107	 * Serve the SPA from static/ with a deep-link fallback: an unknown, non-API path returns
108	 * index.html so a browser refresh on a client route works. OfficeFloor REST routes and Spring
109	 * endpoints are matched first; only unmatched, non-{@code api/} paths fall through to the SPA.
110	 * TODO: confirm the API path prefix used by the OfficeFloor routes ("api/" assumed here).
111	 */
